window.products.push({"id":240015,"name":"Initial Christmas Ornaments w/Name - 6 Shape - Personalized Xmas Wood Ornament for Christmas Tree Decorations - Custom Gifts (Socks)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812V1XS0kZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEST TIME OF THE YEAR: Christmas is the holiest period of the year. Get together with your loved ones and have a nice Christmas. The christmas tree is of course the most important decor of the day. Decorate your Christmas tree with custom ornaments that we have specially designed for you. Design special ornaments for your loved ones. These Christmas Ornament Decor will be a cute gift that family remember and keep for years. CUSTOM NOEL ORNAMENT: All Christmas Tree Ornament decor can customizable with Your Name and Initial. We offer some options like 6 Shape, 5 Theme (santa, elf, reindeer, snowman, xmas candy). We offer 6 Ornament Shape like Round, Christmas Tree, Bell, Sock, Heart & Star. Choose your favorite options and create your unique ornament decor. Ornament sizes can change based on shapes. You can see it on photos. Christmas tree will look perfect with this Personalized Initial Ornaments for Xmas tree decor SAME DAY FREE SHIPPING - 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: All Your Christmas ornament orders will be ready in 24-hours. Customer satisfaction is more important to us than anything else. Personalized Xmas Tree Ornaments will be vivid & clear. You will fall in love with the print quality. We design and print ‘Custom Noel Wood Ornament Decor’ with high-quality staff & equipment in CALIFORNIA. The Personalized Wooden Ornament design's colors will be vivid as you wish. We are here for your satisfaction. FUNNY CHRISTMAS GIFT: All Personalized Initial Ornament Decors are customizable. In this way, you can create custom gifts for Dad, Mom, Grandpa, Grandma, Wife, Husband, Grandparent, Brother, Sister Boyfriend, Daughter, Son. Make your loved ones happy with custom Christmas ornament. You can customize it for Christmas or daily use. You can print name or what do you want to type on the Christmas Decorations. It can be good decor for Christmas Tree, Home, Indoor, Gift Card. HIGH QUALITY: Custom Christmas Initial Wood Ornaments are made of 100% pine wood to ensure strong, durable, and long-term without deformation. DESIGNED & PRINTED IN CALIFORNIA: We are using first-class printers to print your Personalized Initial Wood Ornament Decor for maximum durability. Each of our Personalized Xmas/Noel Initial Ornaments are made of high-quality wood material, and make the custom gift/present. Click ‘Add to Cart’ now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812V1XS0kZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zexpa Apparel","source_asin":"B0BHDHBHHB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHDHBHHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHDHBHHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
