window.products.push({"id":240127,"name":"Tea Infuser 2 Sizes for Loose Leaf Tea,Stainless Steel Tea Balls with Brush (2-Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJCcISrEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Living&Giving stainless steel tea balls for loose tea was designed to make brewing a cup of tea as easy as possible Loose leaf tea expands and needs lots of room when steeping to ensure the best flavor, this infuser is large enough and allows optimal water flow. It allows the tea to fully expand and ensures that you get the true and full flavor of your favorite loose leaf teas. Use Living&Giving Tea Infuser to enjoy the perfect cup of tea. Why Should You Choose The Living&Giving Tea Balls For Loose Tea? Built To Last: With solid construction of 304 grade stainless steel, this mesh tea infuser set by Living&Giving is going to be a staple in your kitchen for a long time to come. A Perfect Gift: You’d be surprised how many people simply aren’t aware just how good their tea can taste if it’s properly steeped. Share the tea taste sensation with them every day – gift them this tea infuser set on the next special occasion or for no reason at all. They’ll love you for it many times over! When It Comes To Preparing Premium Tea, Make Sure You’re Using Premium Tools. It also can be used as a bouquet garni holder when cooking, and you will have a fancy dinner with your family and friends. We promise that you and your guests will be able to taste the difference! How to use: Unfasten clasp to open mesh ball. Scoop a desired quantity of tea leaves into the ball. Close mesh ball and place inside a teacup/teapot. Add recently boiled water over the leaves and steep to your liking. When tea is ready, remove mesh ball and keep aside. Clean out contents to reuse mesh ball. Package includes: 2 different sizes Tea Ball Strainers (2.5 Inch&2 Inch)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJCcISrEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Living&Giving","source_asin":"B07GDDLFLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GDDLFLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GDDLFLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
