window.products.push({"id":240184,"name":"Generations by Garner Lewis, 14x19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O11rCeeYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features abstract human figures. Garner Lewis started drawing at the age of 10. Her father recognized her natural ability to draw and always encouraged her to create. She is a self-taught artists and originally from Columbus, Ohio. Garner uses a variety of media in creating her work. She is mostly known for her mixed media collage creations. Her art is primarily made of the paper that she makes found objects, acrylic paint and fabrics. She is also known for her hand crafted one-of-a-kind art plates and African masks. When creating her masks, Garner uses authentic mud cloths from parts of Africa. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O11rCeeYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B005AIB1D2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005AIB1D2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005AIB1D2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
