window.products.push({"id":240243,"name":"BOSKA Tea Light Tapas Fondue Set for Cheese or Chocolate, Explore Collection, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6K9xplWL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tapas Fondue GoudaWhether it's a sweet summer evening or cold winter weather, the Tapas Fondue Gouda will melt everyone's heart. Pick out your favorite fondue cheese or chocolate, experiment, and enjoy.- FONDUE FUN: Works for both cheese and chocolate- MICROWAVE SAFE: Melted cheese or chocolate in a flash - no stove needed- SIMPLE & ELEGANT: Heated by a candle - no lighter fluid, no cordsCheese Fondue: A Grand Swiss TraditionThe word fondue is a form of the French verb fondre (\"to melt\"). It's a dish that's gaining more and more popularity -because who doesn't love dipping bread and other garnishes into fresh, hot cheese? The most classic Swiss fondue recipe is made with cheeses such as Gruy're, and Emmentaler. However, cheese fondue comes in many varieties. The ready made versions found in the supermarkets are usually a fine starting point to invent your own creations.Perfect for PartiesHave a fondue party! The tapas fondue's convenient size makes it ideal for sampling different types of cheese fondues across a broad buffet table. They can also be used to keep sauces warm. Don't forget one or two chocolate fondues with strawberries and marshmallows for dessert!MaintenanceThe fondue pot is microwave safe as well as dishwasher safe.Contents- 200 mL stoneware fondue pot- Ceramic base- 2 stainless steel fondue forks with plastic handles- 1 tea lightAbout Boska Holland Cheese waresWe love cheese! Since 1896, here at Boska, it’s been our mission to spread the love of cheese to everyone everywhere. Our innovative family-owned company started as a blacksmith making tools for the cheese farmers in Holland, and now we are the world's only specialist in Cheese wares: cheese tools and accessories. In short: we sell everything you need to enjoy cheese except the cheese itself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6K9xplWL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B00JUDUET0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JUDUET0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JUDUET0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
