window.products.push({"id":240250,"name":"GOOD & GRACIOUS Corner Curio Cabinet with Lights, Adjustable Tempered Glass Shelves, Mirrored Back, Display Cabinet,Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wV7NCNwUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Artistic and Utility】: Corner curio cabinets have a grand and lavish appearance, paired with moderate storage capabilities. It's a perfect way to show off figurines, vintage books,fine china, or your other favorite mementos.Besides putting your treasures on display, it is a fabulous piece to enliven an empty corner. 【Show Off Your Collectibles】: Curio cabinet with light system in the top panel is featured with mirrored back and glass sides that enhance the aesthetic allure and make your treasured items shine. Furthermore, glass shelves allow more light to filter throughout the interior. LIGHT BULB NOT INCLUDED. 【Durable and Safe】: Curio cabinets with glass doors and shelves is crafted from high quality engineered wood and has a natural walnut finish that shows off the wood's unique grain color variation. Elegant arched top and ornamental brass handles to create the feeling of vintage and retro we love. Wood-framed tempered glass doors provide a secure and dust-free interior and anti-dumping belts ensure the stability of the cabinet. 【Adjustable Shelves】:This lighted corner curio cabinet offers 2 fixed shelves and 3 tempered glass shelves, which is best for valuable or fragile items.The tempered glass shelves can also be removed if you would like to display taller items. Overall Dimensions: 70.25\"H*21.5\"W*15.75\"D, Holds up to 125 lbs. Each of the shelves can hold up to 25 pounds of distributed weight. 【Assembly required】: Complete instructions are provided and corner china cabinet is easier for two people to install this cabinet together. we care about every customer satisfaction and offer you professional customer service both before and after your purchase. Contact us whenever you have any question, we will give you a satisfying response.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wV7NCNwUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOOD & GRACIOUS","source_asin":"B089CTSTXL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CTSTXL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CTSTXL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
