window.products.push({"id":240323,"name":"Qeils Full Size 100% Waterproof Bamboo Mattress Protector 3D Air Fabric Breathable Cooling Mattress Cover with Deep Pocket Ultra Soft Noiseless Bed Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ohGuaIepL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooling Bamboo Surface: Combining the natural fibers of bamboo with a soft stretch casing, our mattress protector is not only moisture wicking and breathable, but also gives you the luxurious feel of cooling. The surface of the protector is made of 100% bamboo viscose, providing an extra layer of protection that allows air to flow freely around you while moisture can be easily absorbed and wicked away from the body to keep you cool and dry through the night. Soft & Breathable Interlayer: Due to the existence of a waterproof TPU layer at the bottom, we can't achieve complete ventilation in our mattress protectors. However, this problem can be alleviated to some extent through the hollow air layer inside our 3D Air Fabric. This layer also increases softness and comfort while laying down, providing you with a comfortable sleep every single night. Suitable for All Season: Our mattress cover is crafted to provide a feeling of coolness on your skin and maintain its temperature. The protector provides 3D air fabric interlayer, which has good thermal insulation property to prevent the loss of heat in winter, ensuring a warm bed especially in winter. The coolness of bamboo fiber surface keep your skin cooling and refreshing, makes sure that your body will not too hot in summer. 100% Waterproof & Soft: Mattresses can be expensive and worth investing in, so the best way to protect it is by placing our mattress protector on top of your bed. This protector is made out of TPU, which will repel all liquids including accidental spills, body fluids like sweat or urine. At the same time it provides that soft feel that you desire as you sleep on your mattress. Noiseless & Convenient: No worrying about the TPU bottom rubbing against the mattress to make noise. Our waterproof mattress protector is designed with pocket that have high elasticity and can be tightly fixed with the mattress to prevent them from rubbing. The pocket length is 18'' to 21'', enough to meet the size of most mattresses. When washing is needed, set separately in a washing machine on a gentle cycle in cold water, tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ohGuaIepL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qeils","source_asin":"B09XDJRBTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDJRBTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDJRBTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
