window.products.push({"id":240348,"name":"Koroda Pot Holders for Kitchen: Heat Resistant Hot Pads with Cotton Terry Cloth and Non-Slip Silicone Grips for Cooking and Baking (Set of 2, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ro4iEuFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH HEAT RESISTANT UP TO 500°F: Our pot holder is designed for handling the hottest pots and pans. To shield hands from heat, our sturdy potholder is quilted with heavyweight cotton twill on the outside and thick protective cotton terry inside. 100% ORGANIC COTTON: Our pot holders are made from organic cotton terry cloth lining. They are more comfortable, breathable and environmentally friendly than the cheap polyester linings from others. EXTRA PROTECTION: 60% of you want protection for your full hands, so we make the hot pad longer and put a terry cloth on its back to prevent hot oil from spraying to you when you are using the stove, oven and grill. NON-SLIP: The surface of our pot holders are enhanced with an silicon design. You don't need to worry about items slipping out of your grasp even in a humid environment, no matter if it is hot, heavy, or slippery. EASY TO STORE & CLEAN: The kitchen pot holder come with a practical hanging loop, perfect for smaller sized kitchens. It is easy to store and hang them near the oven or stove so that it can be used at any time. The hotpads are quite easy to clean and store, in addition to being machine- or hand-washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ro4iEuFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"koroda","source_asin":"B09DG1CZVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DG1CZVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DG1CZVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
