window.products.push({"id":240413,"name":"Rose Gold Party Decorations | 24 Pack | 16 R. Gold Balloons 18 INCHES + a Table Runner + a Set Happy Birthday + a R. Gold Curtain + 30M Ribbon + 700 p","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5FVt05hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This bundle includes 6 of Amazon's most POPULAR rose gold party decorations!  Your elegant, premium party set includes 16 GORGEOUS large-sized (18 inch) rose gold balloons, 700 pieces in 1-inch circle of beautiful rose gold table confetti, a full-sized (12 inches by 9 feet!) SPARKLING rose gold sequined table runner, 1 piece 1M x 2M rose gold Curtain, 1 set 16 inch Giant Rose Gold Happy Birthday, and 30 meters of metallic rose gold balloon ribbon,and 4 Round Mylar Balloons  This rose gold party decoration set is guaranteed to add INSTANT GLAM to your party scene -- And best of all, it's SO EASY for you! NOTE: **PLEASE USE HIGH QUALITY HELIUM TO FILL YOUR CONFETTI BALLOONS** Cheaper, low grade helium does not have enough power to keep the balloons floating for more than a couple of hours. Also, please inflate to the FULL 18 inches. Confetti Balloon Tips: Please use approximately 90% helium and 10% air. Inflate your balloon most of the way full with helium, then finish it off with a puff of air. Having a little oxygen in your balloon will enable the confetti to hold static & it will stick to the sides more easily! Once your confetti-filled balloon is inflated, create some really good static by rubbing the balloon quickly with a piece of fleece. (Hair, carpeting, or faux fur work too.) Please note that how well the confetti sticks is dependent on conditions like humidity & temperature, but creating static will help combat these conditions! Additionally, a TINY bit of regular water, sugar water, or hairspray (so it is sticky) can be added to the balloon when you are blowing it up. This will also encourage the confetti to stick; however there may be some streaking on the inside of the balloon. Please note: Hi-Float is NOT recommended for the confetti balloons UNLESS you hold the confetti separately while rubbing the hi-float around the balloon .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5FVt05hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"zorpia","source_asin":"B07GR5XZKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GR5XZKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GR5XZKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":240414,"name":"SCANPAN Professional 7 qt Dutch Oven with Lid - Easy-to-Use Nonstick Cookware - Dishwasher, Metal Utensil & Oven Safe - Made in Denmark","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AsT2boDHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NONSTICK WITHOUT COMPROMISE - Forget everything you think you know about nonstick. The SCANPAN Professional Dutch Oven makes stews, roasts & bakes bread like professional cookware—on a revolutionary nonstick surface that requires little to no oil. EASY TO USE - The recycled squeeze-cast aluminum construction distributes heat quickly and evenly, with no hot spots, making any cooking task a breeze. Plus, cleaning only requires soap, water, and a little effort. VERSATILE - Use your Professional Dutch Oven on any gas or electric stovetop, and get the cooking-show-worthy results you want—with or without oil! To save you space & money, it’s compatible with any 10.25” lid from any SCANPAN line. BUILT TO LAST - For 50+ years, SCANPAN has been producing durable, artisan cookware for professional chefs & home cooks. Our STRATANIUM nonstick surface is dishwasher safe, metal utensil safe, and oven safe up to 500°F. SAFE & SUSTAINABLE - These two values are part of our DNA. All SCANPAN products are made of recycled aluminum, and manufactured under the strictest standards required by the Danish government.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AsT2boDHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scanpan","source_asin":"B00ACGHADW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ACGHADW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ACGHADW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
