window.products.push({"id":240446,"name":"Housel Living -GRY Sectional, DARK GREY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91szfxqxvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Family room/ living room sectional sofa with an extra wide double chaise lounge for maximum comfort and space. Ultra soft and durable velvet fabric upholstery, loose back pillows for a plush look and comfort. Sits up to 6 people comfortably. Available in various fun and vibrant colors to best fit your home decor. Plush and durable memory foam seat cushions with modern chrome finish legs. Some assembly is required - assembly instructions and hardware included. Dimensions: 29\"H x 130. 5\"W x 52. 2\"D inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91szfxqxvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Housel Living","source_asin":"B0818QDVYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0818QDVYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0818QDVYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":240447,"name":"Mark Roberts Christmas 2020 Traditional Santa Ornament, 8 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jngpK4EJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Mark Roberts brand symbolizes a mastery of craftsmanship and the most elegantly designed products in the wholesale Gift and Home Decor industry. The company which began in Santa Ana, California in 1984 is famous for its highly desirable Fairy, Elf, Santa, and Witch dolls have enjoyed a tremendous following from consumers and collectors across the world for over 30 years. Each collection adds a lovely and delightful touch to any space. Decorate with vibrant colors for spring and summer, earthy tones for autumn, merry and bright colors for the holidays, and stylish and elegant all-year-round pieces. Bring these elements into your home through a Mark Roberts piece today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jngpK4EJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mark Roberts","source_asin":"B08FXPP467","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FXPP467","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FXPP467","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":240448,"name":"KATE POSH Hawaii Tropical Flower Hibiscus Love Engraved Wood Picture Frame - Weddings, 5th Anniversary, Valentine's, Husband & Wife Gifts, Honeymoon, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iE3V5mNqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Did you go somewhere tropical with your love? Perhaps a Honeymoon? What better souvenir to have than a framed photo of you and that special someone enjoying the sunshine than with this artfully designed and engraved Hawaiian Floral Frame that is titled \"Love\"? Hibiscus flowers beautifully adorn each letter and heart design. This is also a great frame for a family or as they like to call it in Hawaii \"Ohana\" which means family. Grab that Hawaiian shirt and say \"Aloha\" because that photo is gonna look great in this frame. Even if you didn't just go on a tropical vacation, Valentine's day and anniversaries are also a wonderful time to give a gift like this.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iE3V5mNqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KATE POSH","source_asin":"B00T8LTK4O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T8LTK4O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T8LTK4O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":240449,"name":"London Pottery Globe Teapot, Matt Black, 6 Cup, Closed Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f2WavejuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The London Pottery Ranges of Teapots and Accessories combines timeless elegance with modern design and production techniques. The Globe Teapot Range is manufactured from high quality ceramic and offers a wide variety of both size and colour. Designed to both look elegant and traditional the spouts have been developed over years to prevent dripping. Unlike less expensive options there is a ceramic grid at the base of the spout to prevent tea bags lodging in the spout thereby ensuring a smooth flow of tea when pouring. In addition the lid design ensures that the lid will not fall off when pouring. To clean, simply rinse with warm water. If a more thorough wash is required then you can either wash in warm soapy water or run through the dishwahser. The Teapots (not Filter) are also microwave safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f2WavejuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dexam","source_asin":"B001APVLTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001APVLTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001APVLTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
