window.products.push({"id":240532,"name":"OurWarm Oil Sprayer for Cooking, 2Pack Olive Oil Sprayer, Glass Oil Spray Bottle, Portable Oil Dispenser Mister for Kitchen,Air Fryer,Outdoor BBQ,Sala","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61znvcj0PfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【HIGH-END QUALITY】The cooking spray bottle is made of 304 high-quality stainless steel and food-grade glass, completely free of BPA, environmentally friendly material, with large area buttons, easy to press and control the dose, the top of the wave strip is scratch-resistant and non-slip.The design is very compact and will not slip off. The nozzle is hidden in the cover, which can effectively prevent dust, and there is no need to worry about leakage. 【OIL INJECTION CONTROL】We enlarge the spray olive oil bottle of the nozzle to make the spraying area larger than others, and produce a more delicate mist without using any dangerous propellant, so that the oil on your food is more even. And you will not accidentally add more oil when you are cooking, in order to achieve the effect of controlling fat and reducing calorie intake,make you eat healthy and live a healthy life. 【MULTI-PURPOSE】This spray bottle for oil is a good helper for your kitchen. It can be used to fill various seasonings, such as olive oil, vinegar, soy sauce, vegetable oil, sauce, lemon and lime juice, sherry or wine, etc. And it is widely used in salad making, cooking, baking, baking, frying, grilling and other cooking processes. 【EASY TO USE AND CLEAN】You only need to click the pressure pump to spray a uniform mist and control the amount of oil used in each cooking. The unobstructed hose will not cause the oil bottles for kitchen to block. After use, you can open the lid and rinse with some detergent or hot water, put the included cleaning brush into the bottle and stir 6-10 times, and then you will get a new olive oil sprayer mister. 【EASY TO CARRY】Our cooking oil dispenser is small and exquisite, with a lightweight design, and a very portable size (7.28inch x 1.89inch). You can take it for picnics, barbecues, working lunches or travel, and bring your favorite flavors to any place and share it with everyone . Both beautiful and durable, it is an excellent choice for gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61znvcj0PfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OurWarm","source_asin":"B08TC6338G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TC6338G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TC6338G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
