window.products.push({"id":240558,"name":"Natural Crystal Purple Orgone Rune Set Stones Resin Set with Engraved Elder Futhark Alphabet Crystal Meditation Divination Healing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81om1JsgKKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color : Purple | Material : ResinRunes are the letters in a set of related alphabets known as runic alphabets, which were used to write various Germanic languages before the adoption of the Latin alphabet and for specialised purposes thereafter.Rune reading, also called rune casting, is a divination tool that uses stones with symbols to answer questions about your past, present, and future. Rune stones can also help you get clarification or advice on how to address an issue or problem. Start by getting rune stones and choosing a comfortable, sunny setting.Elder Futhark Rune Meanings. Runes are the mystical alphabet used by ancient European tribes 2000 years ago to name places and things, attract luck and fortune, provide protection, and magically divine the course of future events.You get a total of 25 rune stones. 24 Elder Futhark Runes and 1 blank. Benefits of Reiki: Ø Dissolves energy blocks and promotes natural balance between mind, body and spiritØ Increases energy levels and connection to selfØ Creates deep relaxation and helps the body release stress and tensionØ Clears the mind and improves focusØ Accelerates the body’s self-healing abilityØ Helps spiritual growth and emotional cleansingSize 2 CM Approx.Our Runes are made of high quality natural materials. In addition, we use exclusively natural minerals. All work is done manually. Each tree is individual – it is impossible to repeat the work exactly. Because in nature there are no two identical crystals in shape, size, and structure.Runes are designed to protect the human biological field from harmful radiation, clean and harmonize space, the natural charging of the body with positive energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81om1JsgKKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Crystal","source_asin":"B08VJ3PDNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJ3PDNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJ3PDNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
