window.products.push({"id":240591,"name":"Anawah Light Filtering Zebra Blinds Fabric Swatch Sample 9 Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91smC8Xj69L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ever wished you could effectively control how much sunlight enters your room? Although it’s considerably healthy, having natural light in your home is not always something you desire. At times, it’s better when it’s dim—or even dark. You’re desperate to replace your unreliable curtains that can barely stay in place to cover your whole window. If only there is a home accessory that’s capable of turning your space into a cozy, low-lit haven. Keep your room ideally lit throughout the day with the Anawah Roller Shades. We can all agree that some activities, such as movie marathons and afternoon naps, are best enjoyed in low light conditions. That’s why we designed our roller window blinds to suit most window types and interior decor, so you can easily integrate them in your home and finally have more control over your interior lighting. To get the right size of roller shades for inside mounting, measure the window’s width in three places and use the narrowest measurement to guarantee a proper fit. For outside mount, we recommend a 4-inch overlap (1-1/2-inch each side). Each roller shades package contains all the necessary mounting brackets to ensure hassle-free installation. If needed, you may reach for tools and fasteners (not included) to make the process easier. Need more reasons to get this window accessory? Check out these awesome benefits: ? Easy to maintain, it only needs to be wiped clean with wet cloth ? Great for apartments, condominiums, offices and co-working spaces ? Stylish choice for any season Say goodbye to “too-bright” indoor conditions. Add Anawah Roller Shades to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91smC8Xj69L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANAWAH","source_asin":"B085BVVPM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085BVVPM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085BVVPM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
