window.products.push({"id":240775,"name":"Klee 6-Piece Premium Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls with Laser Etched Measuring Lines (Set of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41STH+O2sHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Professional Chef-Grade Cookware Add modern style and professional performance to your everyday meal prep, cooking and baking with these beautiful bowls! Crafted in high grade stainless steel with laser-etched measurements, these mixing bowls are perfect for cooking, baking and meal prep. Practical and appealing, our mixing bowls are a fantastic addition to your kitchen! Accurate Measuring Each bowl includes laser-etched measurements in liters and quarts on the inside, making it easy to keep track of volume and ingredients. Laser-etched measurements will never smudge or fade, providing you with reliable, efficient measuring! A fill line is included below the rim of the bowl to keep you from overfilling the bowl, which reduces spills and spatter. Brushed Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls with Flat Base A wide, rolled lip makes it easier to grip the rim of the bowl and the flat base adds stability while you whip up a meal! The wide lip makes it easy to pour batter from the bowl. All materials are food-safe, non-toxic . 6 Nesting Sizes This set includes 5 sizes: .75 qt, 1.5 qt, 3 qt, 4 qt, 5 qt and 8 qt.A variety of sizes ensures that you’ll have a bowl for every need, from whisking eggs to tossing salad and whipping up cake batter. Our bowls nest into each other, making cleanup and storage a breeze! Easy Care & Cleaning Stainless steel is one of the best materials to work with in the kitchen, Our bowls are dishwasher safe and can withstand high temperatures to be cleaned, We advise against using sharp metal utensils on the inside of our bowls as they can dull the beautiful, mirrored finish. Klee Utensil mixing bowls will stay shiny and keep looking brand new, even after years of use! Add this pro mixing bowl set to your kitchen today and transform your cooking experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41STH+O2sHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KLEE UTENSILS","source_asin":"B07VGJ1KJD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VGJ1KJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VGJ1KJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
