window.products.push({"id":240887,"name":"SMART EATZ Air Fryer Silicone Pot Liner - {2 Pack} Square Air Fryer Basket Liners - 8 Inch Reusable, Use For Oven And Microwave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wMG-ZIvaL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Introducing Smart Eatz: Tools That Make Using Your Kitchen Easier If you have an air fryer, then you know how frustrating it can be when cleaning the greasy, grimy basket after cooking. This 2 pack of reusable silicone basket liners are the perfect accessory to avoid extra mess and save time cleaning. Their high quality, flexible and durable design will make them a MUST-HAVE in your kitchen. Say Goodbye To Wasteful Parchment Paper Tired of going through tons of parchment paper or other non stick solutions to protect your air fryer basket? Parchment paper is not only wasteful, but it also does not maintain its shape after removing it and can cause even further mess if the food spills. These liners are easy to insert and keep your food secure when removing it. You will be able to use your air fryer more often with ease and less clean up time! Flexible and Durable Design The material is BPA free and food safe silicone that can withstand temperatures of up to 464 F. Multiple uses- it is not only great for your air fryer, but can also be used in your microwave or standard oven. The quality will speak for itself as the raised lined throughout help your food to cook evenly and crispy in all the right places. Wash these liners easily by turning it inside out to rinse the grease with warm water, then simply place in your dishwasher. The material will hold its shape and be ready to use for years to come! *Please measure your air fryer baskets before ordering to confirm the fit of these liners*","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wMG-ZIvaL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Eatz","source_asin":"B0BMBCJHWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMBCJHWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMBCJHWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
