window.products.push({"id":240991,"name":"Silicone Pastry Mat Extra Large, 32\" x 24\" Premium Non-stick Baking Mat with Measurement for Dough Rolling, Non-slip Counter Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+haldKWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extra Large Silicone Pastry Mat with Measurement Not-Slip Rolling Dough Mats for Baking Includes: 1x Silicone pastry mat+ 1x Dough Scraper+ 1x Silicone Brush Silicone Bread Mat Material: 100% high quality food grade silicone Color: red Size for choosing: 40x30CM(15.7x11.8inch) 60x40CM（23.6x15.7inch） 80x60CM（31.5x23.6inch） Feature of Pastry rolling mat -Non-stick surface Only spread a small amount of flour on the surface, this large silicone pastry mat will keep your work surfaces clean so you don’t have to spend hours scraping dried dough off your countertop.Due to the non-stick pastry mat's nonstick surface, you can use our non stick pastry mat to bake without using extra butter or cooking spray which allows you to cook a healthy and vibrant food. -Wide ranges of use The silicone rolling mat is durable and functional, resists temperature from -40°C to 230°C (-40°F to 450°F), no problem for heating and freezing. Suitable for rolling dough, kneading fondant, cutting pasta, making small cake, pudding, jelly, bread, pizza, etc. -Easy to store You can roll the silicone baking mat up or just lay dough rolling mat flat, easy to store and won't occupy much space. -Durable for years Premium quality makes the pie mat serve for years without deforming and fading.Silicone pastry sheet is reusable and heat resistant. Warm notice: 1. Do not use with sharp objects or as a cutting surface. 2. Do not expose directly to open flame. 3. Dry thoroughly after washing. Compared to parchment papers and cooking spray, baking equipment silicone do not affect your food, and the best part is that they can be easily cleaned and used again","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+haldKWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PATIOSIR","source_asin":"B0B8DPJY8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-240991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8DPJY8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8DPJY8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
